      "reviewedAt": "2026-08-24T12:30:55Z",
      "note": "Reviewed the exploit receipt and call trace, the commit-pinned reproduction, the deployment transaction, the exploit-time implementation slot, the independent incident analysis, and a complete Upgraded-event query from deployment through the exploit. The exploit calls proxy 0xa481b139a1a654ca19d2074f174f17d7534e8cec, which delegates to 0x8af92c23a169b58c2e5ac656d8d8a23fc725080f. An external AVAX transfer during the share-buy path permits reentrancy into the weight-setting function before sellShares computes its payout. Two Upgraded events exist; the final event is log 0 of 0x444a7fefbc65586f5d5e00c7575d22f3dffb2ce9874f5197656bf7b59c46b3bd and selects the recorded implementation. The trace transfers exactly 266103.97278 AVAX from the proxy through the attack contracts to the attacker EOA."
